const initial = 0;

const results = customReduce(numbers, initial, [
  (acc, val) => acc + val,
  (acc) => acc * acc,
  (acc) => acc / numbers.length
]);

console.log(results); // Output: [6, 36, 2]
```
This implementation handles the following edge cases:

