The `PaddingMode` parameter specifies the padding scheme to use for the decryption. The available options are `PaddingMode.PKCS7`, `PaddingMode.Zeros`, `PaddingMode.ANSIX923`, `PaddingMode.ISO10126`, and `PaddingMode.None`. The default value is `PaddingMode.PKCS7`.

