The function uses caching mechanisms to optimize performance when checking for duplicate titles by considering caching strategies. It also balances between performance and accuracy in checking for duplicate titles by choosing an appropriate caching strategy.

Finally, the function manages database resources efficiently by optimizing query execution plans and minimizing unnecessary transactions. It ensures efficient management of database resources by using PDO's built-in methods to interact with the database.']

